  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Abana b&apos;Imana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Abana b&#x2019;Imana (children of God) project seeks to improve and benefit the lives of orphansin AEBR Youth in Rwanda. With the help of volunteers and through camps, trainings andgroups of hope, we seek to empower youth and to give orphans hope for a better life. InRwanda, having a family is a big part of your social and financial support system.Therefore, orphans are a vulnerable group who are in general risk, both socially,economically, and emotionally. By training volunteers to engage with this vulnerable groupwe both improve the organizational capacity and volunteer base of AEBR Youth, and givethe orphans and entry point into the church and local society.</narrative>
  </description>
